cked":"已禁止 {mac} 连接 Wi-Fi（MAC 黑名单）","controls.wifi_access_unblocked":"已恢复 {mac} 的 Wi-Fi 访问","controls.wifi_filter_mode":"Wi-Fi MAC 过滤已切换为：{mode}","controls.wifi_filter_entries":"Wi-Fi MAC 过滤名单已更新（{count} 台）","controls.time_rule_created":"已新增上网时段规则：{detail}","controls.time_rule_updated":"已更新上网时段规则：{detail}","controls.time_rule_deleted":"已删除上网时段规则：{detail}","controls.auto_unlock_applied":"WAN 未恢复，已自动解除全部频段与小区锁定","controls.auto_restore_applied":"WAN 未恢复，已自动写回 AI 智能体测试前的频段设置","controls.auto_reconnect_applied":"WAN 已断开，已自动重拨蜂窝数据","controls.experimental_match":"（实验性写入，回读一致）","controls.experimental_mismatch":"（实验性写入，回读不一致：{reason}）","controls.experimental_unknown":"（实验性写入，无法回读核对：{reason}）","controls.experimental_pending":"（实验性写入，之后的轮询会核对它）","sms.sent_summary":"短信已发送至 {to}（{segments} 段）","sms.send_failed_summary":"发往 {to} 的短信发送失败（错误码 {code}）","sms.marked_read_summary":"已在 CPE 上将 {count} 条短信标为已读","sms.deleted_summary":"已从 CPE 删除 {count} 条短信","alerts.cpe_unreachable":"CPE 已连续 {seconds} 秒无法访问：{reason}","alerts.cpe_recovered":"CPE 已恢复访问（中断约 {seconds} 秒）","alerts.wan_down":"蜂窝数据连接已断开超过 {seconds} 秒（状态码 {status}）","alerts.wan_up":"蜂窝数据连接已恢复","alerts.signal_degraded":"{rat} 信号已持续 {minutes} 分钟偏弱：RSRP {rsrp} dBm / SINR {sinr} dB","alerts.signal_recovered":"{rat} 信号已恢复：RSRP {rsrp} dBm / SINR {sinr} dB","alerts.ca_dropped":"载波聚合由 {from} 个载波降为 {to} 个","alerts.reboot_detected":"检测到 CPE 已重启（当前运行 {uptime} 秒）","alerts.sms_storage_high":"短信存储即将占满：{used}/{max}","alerts.sms_storage_full":"短信存储已满（{used}/{max}），将无法接收新短信","alerts.data_threshold":"本月已用流量 {used}，达到 {limit} 套餐的 {percent}%","alerts.lock_drift":"锁定配置与路由器实际状态不一致：{issue}","alerts.lock_realigned":"路由器已重新符合当前锁定配置","alerts.duplicate_daemon_standby":"另一台机器（{address}）上的烽燧也在管理这台路由器：这里转入待机，暂停访问路由器和 Telegram，直到对方停止","alerts.duplicate_daemon_leader":"另一台机器（{address}）上的烽燧也在管理这台路由器：对方已转入待机，请停掉其中一个","alerts.duplicate_daemon_cleared":"另一个烽燧已经停止，这里恢复管理路由器","alerts.data_quarantined":"以下数据文件无法用当前 DATA_ENCRYPTION_KEY 解密（用别的密钥写的、已损坏，或者没有加密），已改名隔离（未删除）：{files}。先运行 cpe-dash doctor 查看是哪一种，再用 cpe-dash rekey 找回（文档的「备份与恢复」一页有步骤）","alerts.storage_write_failed":"无法保存 {file}（{reason}）：这次更改只在内存里，重启前若仍无法保存就会丢失。请检查数据卷的剩余空间与权限（同一文件同一原因每小时只提醒一次）","alerts.lock_rolled_back":"锁定后 {minutes} 分钟 WAN 仍未恢复，已自动解除全部频段与小区锁定（LOCK_ROLLBACK_AFTER_MIN）","alerts.lock_rollback_failed":"锁定后 WAN 仍未恢复，但自动解锁没有完成：{reason}。请在局域网内打开控制台手动解除锁定","alerts.experiment_lock_rolled_back":"AI 智能体测试时锁定了频段，{minutes} 分钟后 WAN 仍未恢复，已自动解除全部频段与小区锁定","alerts.experiment_lock_restored":"AI 智能体测试时锁定了频段，{minutes} 分钟后 WAN 仍未恢复，已自动写回测试前的频段设置","alerts.wan_auto_reconnect":"WAN 已断开 {minutes} 分钟，已自动重拨（24 小时内第 {count}/{max} 次；烽燧从不自动重启路由器）","alerts.wan_reconnect_exhausted":"WAN 仍未恢复，24 小时内的 {max} 次自动重拨已用完；烽燧不会自动重启路由器，请检查 SIM 卡、套餐或基站","alerts.self_heal_read_only_reconnect":"WAN 已断开 {minutes} 分钟。烽燧本会自动重拨（WAN_AUTO_RECONNECT_AFTER_MIN），但这台路由器（{model}）是没有验证过的型号，没有在「设置 → 设备」打开实验性重拨，烽燧不写入：请在路由器自己的网页上重拨或重启","alerts.self_heal_read_only_rollback":"锁定之后 WAN 仍未恢复，但这台路由器（{model}）是烽燧没有验证过的型号，没有在「设置 → 设备」打开实验性锁频，烽燧不会自动解除锁定（LOCK_ROLLBACK_AFTER_MIN）：请在路由器自己的网页上解除","alerts.model_unverified":"路由器报告的型号是 {model}，烽燧没有在这个型号上验证过（已验证：{verified}）：烽燧只读取它，路由器提供的监控照常可用，写操作默认锁定。控制台「设置 → 设备」可以查看它支持哪些功能、逐项打开实验性写入（先看风险说明），并提交兼容性报告","alerts.firmware_unverified":"路由器报告 {model} 固件 {version}，烽燧只在 {verified} 上验证过协议：锁频、访问控制和短信等写操作可能不兼容。配置了 Telegram 时，推送会附带一段可交给编程智能体（如 Claude Code）核对兼容性的提示词","alerts.write_readback_mismatch":"实验性写入 {action} 在 {model} 上回读不一致：{reason}。路由器可能没有按请求生效；「设置 → 设备」列出最近的写入结果，可以附在兼容性报告里","alerts.agent_test_still_on":"AI 智能体测试打开的设置还开着（{model}）：{items}。测完了请在「设置 → 设备」点「结束测试」，烽燧会恢复测试前的设置。在控制台的通知里看过这条提醒，或在 Telegram 里点了「知道了」，就不再提醒"},"en":{"controls.band_lock_applied":"Band lock applied: {summary}","controls.cell_lock_applied":"{rat} cell/frequency lock applied: Band {band}, ARFCN {arfcn}","controls.unlock_all_applied":"Cleared all band and cell locks; restored automatic full-band selection","controls.reboot_confirm_required":"Safety guard: reboot requires explicit confirm: true","controls.reboot_triggered":"Router reboot command dispatched; link will recover in ~45-90s","controls.reconnect_triggered":"Cellular WAN reconnect command dispatched","controls.security_updated":"Security switches (UPnP / DMZ / Firewall) updated","controls.wifi7_updated":"Wi-Fi 7 MLO / Dual-Band Handover settings updated","controls.antenna_updated":"Antenna mode switched to: {mode}","controls.mobile_data_updated":"Mobile data master switch updated","controls.yielded_cannot_mutate":"Someone is using the router's admin page (192.168.8.1); to avoid signing them out, this action was cancelled","controls.peer_daemon_active":"FengSui on another machine ({address}) manages this router; this one is on standby and stays off the router","controls.device_read_only":"Writes are locked: FengSui was verified on {verified} only, and this router ({model}) is another model, so FengSui only reads it. Writes FengSui can do here can be turned on one at a time as experimental writes under Settings → Device, which can also report how the router works","controls.device_not_identified":"Writes are locked until FengSui knows the router's model, and this time it could not read it (device/information). Nothing was written","controls.wifi_access_blocked":"Blocked {mac} from Wi-Fi (MAC blacklist)","controls.wifi_access_unblocked":"Restored Wi-Fi access for {mac}","controls.wifi_filter_mode":"Wi-Fi MAC filter switched to: {mode}","controls.wifi_filter_entries":"Wi-Fi MAC filter list updated ({count} devices)","controls.time_rule_created":"Internet time rule added: {detail}","controls.time_rule_updated":"Internet time rule updated: {detail}","controls.time_rule_deleted":"Internet time rule deleted: {detail}","controls.auto_unlock_applied":"The WAN did not come back: cleared every band and cell lock automatically","controls.auto_restore_applied":"The WAN did not come back: wrote back the band setting from before the AI agent's test","controls.auto_reconnect_applied":"The WAN is down: redialled the cellular data connection automatically","controls.experimental_match":" (experimental write, read back: matches)","controls.experimental_mismatch":" (experimental write, read back: differs, {reason})","controls.experimental_unknown":" (experimental write, not checked: {reason})","controls.experimental_pending":" (experimental write, the next polls check it)","sms.sent_summary":"SMS sent to {to} ({segments} segment(s))","sms.send_failed_summary":"SMS to {to} failed (code {code})","sms.marked_read_summary":"Marked {count} SMS as read on the CPE","sms.deleted_summary":"Deleted {count} SMS from the CPE","alerts.cpe_unreachable":"CPE unreachable for {seconds}s: {reason}","alerts.cpe_recovered":"CPE reachable again after ~{seconds}s","alerts.wan_down":"Cellular data connection down for over {seconds}s (status {status})","alerts.wan_up":"Cellular data connection restored","alerts.signal_degraded":"{rat} signal degraded for {minutes} min: RSRP {rsrp} dBm / SINR {sinr} dB","alerts.signal_recovered":"{rat} signal recovered: RSRP {rsrp} dBm / SINR {sinr} dB","alerts.ca_dropped":"Carrier aggregation dropped from {from} to {to} component carrier(s)","alerts.reboot_detected":"CPE reboot detected (uptime {uptime}s)","alerts.sms_storage_high":"SMS storage nearly full: {used}/{max}","alerts.sms_storage_full":"SMS storage full ({used}/{max}); new messages cannot be received","alerts.data_threshold":"Monthly data {used} reached {percent}% of the {limit} plan","alerts.lock_drift":"The router no longer matches the applied lock: {issue}","alerts.lock_realigned":"The router matches the applied lock again","alerts.duplicate_daemon_standby":"FengSui on another machine ({address}) also manages this router: this one went on standby (no router access, no Telegram) until it stops","alerts.duplicate_daemon_leader":"FengSui on another machine ({address}) also manages this router: it went on standby; stop one of them","alerts.duplicate_daemon_cleared":"The other FengSui stopped; this one manages the router again","alerts.data_quarantined":"These data files could not be decrypted with the current DATA_ENCRYPTION_KEY (written under another key, damaged, or stored without encryption) and were moved aside (not deleted): {files}. Run cpe-dash doctor to see which, then bring them back with cpe-dash rekey (the backup page of the guide shows how)","alerts.storage_write_failed":"Could not save {file} ({reason}): the change is only in memory and is lost on restart unless a save works again. Check the free space and permissions of the data volume (said once an hour per file and cause)","alerts.lock_rolled_back":"The WAN was still down {minutes} min after the lock, so every band and cell lock was cleared automatically (LOCK_ROLLBACK_AFTER_MIN)","alerts.lock_rollback_failed":"The WAN is still down after the lock, but the automatic unlock did not complete: {reason}. Clear the locks from the console on the LAN","alerts.experiment_lock_rolled_back":"An AI agent's test locked bands and the WAN was still down {minutes} min later, so every band and cell lock was cleared automatically","alerts.experiment_lock_restored":"An AI agent's test locked bands and the WAN was still down {minutes} min later, so the band setting from before the test was written back automatically","alerts.wan_auto_reconnect":"The WAN has been down for {minutes} min; redialled automatically ({count}/{max} in 24 h; FengSui never reboots the router on its own)","alerts.wan_reconnect_exhausted":"The WAN is still down and the {max} automatic redials for the last 24 h are used up; FengSui never reboots the router on its own: check the SIM, the plan or the cell","alerts.self_heal_read_only_reconnect":"The WAN has been down for {minutes} min. FengSui would redial it (WAN_AUTO_RECONNECT_AFTER_MIN), but this router ({model}) is a model it was not verified on and its experimental redial is not turned on under Settings → Device, so it writes nothing: redial or restart it on the router's own page","alerts.self_heal_read_only_rollback":"The WA